  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demand-led Technical Assistance to support the Enabling Environment for Private Climate Finance.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will establish a flexible TA facility to address longer term policy and regulatory gaps that in turn improve the viability of growing a re-generating climate investment pipeline in Pakistan. Taking a demand-led, investor-oriented approach, it will focus on regulatory frameworks, economic policies, and incentives to create an investment environment that will incentivise increased private investment in low emission climate-resilient investments.</narrative>
  </description>
